	name = "zdobycze z terenu";
	default_raw_text = "<center><h1>ATTENTION</h1></center>I don't understand what it is about you fucks that means the words <i>do not use Inteq weapons</i> pass through one ear and out the other. It is a liability and your 'field acquisition' of the weapons is only liable to get yourself shot by your friends. It's because of you fucks that I've had to put the 'pretty' FA2 in my personal safe. <b>STOP. FUCKING. TOUCHING. THEM.</b><br><br>- Big Boss Ross"
	},
/obj/item/paper/fluff/ruins{
	pixel_x = 2;
	pixel_y = 8;
	name = "racjonowana amunicja";
	default_raw_text = "<center><h1>ATTENTION</h1><center>I've seen some of you shooting at the wildlife. Fucking stop it. Especially you who I've trusted with an auto-rifle. You're wasting ammo and we're not made of fucking creds.<br><br>- Big Boss Ross"
	},
